{
  "id": "poem-072",
  "body": "<div class=\"poem-text\"><p class=\"poem-stanza\" id=\"verse-1\"><span class=\"poem-line\">虔诚之心渡沧海，执念褪去见真我。</span><span class=\"poem-line\">日夜修行度群生，禅境，梦幻泡影若浮萍。</span><span class=\"poem-line\">菩提道上觅真谛，灵光，逐渐映照心中城。</span><span class=\"poem-line\">始终开悟破尘埃，笑看，红尘繁华转瞬间。</span></p></div><figure class=\"poem-illustration\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"poem-art-open\" data-poem-art=\"/books/jing-mi-de-kuang-chao/art/072.webp\" data-caption=\"《皱纹》\" aria-label=\"放大欣赏插画《皱纹》\"><img src=\"/books/jing-mi-de-kuang-chao/art/072.webp\" width=\"885\" height=\"1050\" alt=\"亮子绘制的原书插画《皱纹》\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></button><figcaption>《皱纹》 · 亮子<span>轻触画面，放大欣赏</span></figcaption></figure><p class=\"poem-original-page\">原书第 72 页</p>"
}
